<title>JAPAN: National House - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>National House - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		120.89		vs	  111.44</p>
<p> Operating	   12.03		vs	   10.52</p>
<p> Current	     11.83		vs	   11.04</p>
<p> Net		    6.24		vs	    5.76</p>
<p> EPS		   36.51 yen	  vs	   33.71 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    172 million	  vs	 171 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    6.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - National House Industrial Co Ltd specialises in housing materials.</p>
</text>
